  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "c01-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Do you know why an AI Agent can become less useful after it remembers more?",
      "gapBefore": 0,
      "audioDuration": 4.392,
      "audioStart": 0,
      "spokenStart": 0.164,
      "spokenEnd": 3.744,
      "actualGapBefore": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Microsoft Research calls this the raw-history problem: long interaction logs mix useful experience with details that no longer matter.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.8,
      "audioStart": 3.749,
      "spokenStart": 3.904,
      "spokenEnd": 10.873,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Then the Agent searches a larger pile, spends context on noise, and can miss the fact or constraint that should change its next action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.68,
      "audioStart": 10.864,
      "spokenStart": 11.033,
      "spokenEnd": 17.888,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This episode gives you an AI Agent retain–distill–forget table: a simple way to decide what stays available, what becomes a compact lesson, and what should stop competing for attention.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 10.224,
      "audioStart": 17.883,
      "spokenStart": 18.048,
      "spokenEnd": 27.445,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The goal is not perfect memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 2.4,
      "audioStart": 27.446,
      "spokenStart": 27.605,
      "spokenEnd": 29.18,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It is decision-ready memory: the smallest set of facts and skills that helps an Agent act correctly now.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 5.976,
      "audioStart": 29.137,
      "spokenStart": 29.28,
      "spokenEnd": 34.468,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This video is packed with practical, high-value insights to help you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.376,
      "audioStart": 34.454,
      "spokenStart": 34.628,
      "spokenEnd": 39.18,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c01-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c01-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 0,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "It's a longer one, so follow Tiny Agent and save it so you don't lose it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.656,
      "audioStart": 39.138,
      "spokenStart": 39.28,
      "spokenEnd": 43.058,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter two: Raw History.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.352,
      "audioStart": 43.093,
      "spokenStart": 43.238,
      "spokenEnd": 44.768,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Learn why a complete log is not automatically a useful memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 44.709,
      "spokenStart": 44.868,
      "spokenEnd": 47.951,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "An interaction record can contain a decision, a failed search, copied text, an obsolete plan, and a temporary tool error all at once.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.472,
      "audioStart": 47.955,
      "spokenStart": 48.111,
      "spokenEnd": 55.785,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Keeping that record is valuable for audit and recovery.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.48,
      "audioStart": 55.794,
      "spokenStart": 55.945,
      "spokenEnd": 58.6,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p03-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Sending all of it back into every new task is a different decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 58.555,
      "spokenStart": 58.7,
      "spokenEnd": 61.782,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The more irrelevant detail the Agent retrieves, the harder it becomes to identify the condition that actually changes the current answer.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.296,
      "audioStart": 61.767,
      "spokenStart": 61.942,
      "spokenEnd": 68.392,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "That is why larger memory can feel like better recall while producing slower, less reliable reasoning.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.808,
      "audioStart": 68.388,
      "spokenStart": 68.552,
      "spokenEnd": 73.516,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Treat history as a source to process, not a bag that must be poured into the next context window.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.688,
      "audioStart": 73.533,
      "spokenStart": 73.676,
      "spokenEnd": 78.559,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 78.573,
      "spokenStart": 78.719,
      "spokenEnd": 79.503,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c02-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, keep raw history for traceability, not as the default prompt.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.488,
      "audioStart": 79.451,
      "spokenStart": 79.603,
      "spokenEnd": 83.293,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, separate the value of storing an event from the value of retrieving it now.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.992,
      "audioStart": 83.305,
      "spokenStart": 83.453,
      "spokenEnd": 87.629,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c02-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c02-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, judge memory by whether it improves the next decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.816,
      "audioStart": 87.639,
      "spokenStart": 87.789,
      "spokenEnd": 90.798,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter three: Useful Units.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.592,
      "audioStart": 90.834,
      "spokenStart": 90.978,
      "spokenEnd": 92.764,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Turn experience into things an AI Agent can reuse.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.672,
      "audioStart": 92.722,
      "spokenStart": 92.864,
      "spokenEnd": 95.745,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The Microsoft Research article describes a shift from storing text chunks toward structured knowledge.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.76,
      "audioStart": 95.744,
      "spokenStart": 95.905,
      "spokenEnd": 100.845,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "One useful unit is a fact: a verified constraint, a current setting, or a result that narrows what the Agent can safely do.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.44,
      "audioStart": 100.848,
      "spokenStart": 101.005,
      "spokenEnd": 107.599,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Another is a reusable skill: a compact procedure that says when to take an action, what evidence to collect, and when to stop.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.368,
      "audioStart": 107.618,
      "spokenStart": 107.759,
      "spokenEnd": 114.337,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Facts answer what is true enough for this task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.096,
      "audioStart": 114.372,
      "spokenStart": 114.497,
      "spokenEnd": 116.805,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Skills answer how to proceed when the same pattern appears again.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.792,
      "audioStart": 116.76,
      "spokenStart": 116.905,
      "spokenEnd": 119.891,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "This transformation removes repeated narration without throwing away the lesson contained in the interaction.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.736,
      "audioStart": 119.887,
      "spokenStart": 120.051,
      "spokenEnd": 124.943,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 124.957,
      "spokenStart": 125.103,
      "spokenEnd": 125.887,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c03-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, promote verified facts out of raw transcripts.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.912,
      "audioStart": 125.85,
      "spokenStart": 125.987,
      "spokenEnd": 129.112,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, capture repeatable procedures as skills, not anecdotes.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.488,
      "audioStart": 129.124,
      "spokenStart": 129.272,
      "spokenEnd": 132.97,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c03-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c03-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, keep each unit small enough to guide one future decision.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.104,
      "audioStart": 132.976,
      "spokenStart": 133.13,
      "spokenEnd": 136.414,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter four: Task Routing.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.472,
      "audioStart": 136.451,
      "spokenStart": 136.594,
      "spokenEnd": 138.237,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Retrieve only the knowledge that belongs to the task in front of you.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.744,
      "audioStart": 138.189,
      "spokenStart": 138.337,
      "spokenEnd": 141.263,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "PlugMem uses high-level concepts and inferred intent as routing signals instead of returning long passages by default.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.128,
      "audioStart": 141.259,
      "spokenStart": 141.423,
      "spokenEnd": 147.735,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "In practical terms, start with the current goal, the entity, the risk, and the next action that needs support.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.6,
      "audioStart": 147.741,
      "spokenStart": 147.895,
      "spokenEnd": 153.63,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use those cues to select a few relevant facts and skills.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.816,
      "audioStart": 153.636,
      "spokenStart": 153.79,
      "spokenEnd": 156.811,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p04-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Do not retrieve every record that shares a broad keyword.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.528,
      "audioStart": 156.749,
      "spokenStart": 156.911,
      "spokenEnd": 159.599,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Before the selected memory reaches the base Agent, distill it into concise guidance: what is known, what matters, and what must still be checked.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.232,
      "audioStart": 159.601,
      "spokenStart": 159.759,
      "spokenEnd": 167.172,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If the answer depends on live information, retrieval is not enough.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.224,
      "audioStart": 167.179,
      "spokenStart": 167.332,
      "spokenEnd": 170.736,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "The Agent still needs fresh evidence from the appropriate source.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.72,
      "audioStart": 170.673,
      "spokenStart": 170.836,
      "spokenEnd": 173.752,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 173.766,
      "spokenStart": 173.912,
      "spokenEnd": 174.696,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c04-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, route memory from the current decision, not from a vague topic match.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.68,
      "audioStart": 174.643,
      "spokenStart": 174.796,
      "spokenEnd": 178.673,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, pass compact guidance instead of a transcript.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 178.682,
      "spokenStart": 178.833,
      "spokenEnd": 181.911,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c04-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c04-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, use fresh evidence whenever the task can change over time.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.2,
      "audioStart": 181.923,
      "spokenStart": 182.071,
      "spokenEnd": 185.457,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter five: Memory Lifecycle.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.736,
      "audioStart": 185.492,
      "spokenStart": 185.637,
      "spokenEnd": 187.549,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Decide whether each item should remain, shrink, or leave the working set.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.416,
      "audioStart": 187.491,
      "spokenStart": 187.649,
      "spokenEnd": 191.186,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Retain an item when it is verified, likely to affect future decisions, and still has a clear retrieval cue.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.528,
      "audioStart": 191.207,
      "spokenStart": 191.346,
      "spokenEnd": 197.04,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Distill an item when the event is long but its lesson can be expressed as a fact, rule, checklist, or handoff note.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.936,
      "audioStart": 197.045,
      "spokenStart": 197.2,
      "spokenEnd": 203.251,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Forget an item from active memory when it is obsolete, duplicated, low-confidence, or only useful as audit history.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.176,
      "audioStart": 203.261,
      "spokenStart": 203.411,
      "spokenEnd": 209.749,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Forgetting from the working set is not deleting evidence.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 3.432,
      "audioStart": 209.762,
      "spokenStart": 209.909,
      "spokenEnd": 212.542,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p05-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Keep the original trace where governance or debugging requires it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.864,
      "audioStart": 212.499,
      "spokenStart": 212.642,
      "spokenEnd": 215.657,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Review dates matter because a once-correct policy, tool result, or customer preference can become misleading after conditions change.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.416,
      "audioStart": 215.662,
      "spokenStart": 215.817,
      "spokenEnd": 222.431,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 222.445,
      "spokenStart": 222.591,
      "spokenEnd": 223.375,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c05-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, retain durable facts with future decision value.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.888,
      "audioStart": 223.325,
      "spokenStart": 223.475,
      "spokenEnd": 226.541,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, distill long experience into a reusable rule or skill.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.32,
      "audioStart": 226.556,
      "spokenStart": 226.701,
      "spokenEnd": 230.2,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c05-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c05-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, remove stale or duplicate material from active retrieval without losing the audit trail.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 5.664,
      "audioStart": 230.203,
      "spokenStart": 230.36,
      "spokenEnd": 235.204,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter six: Memory Table.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 2.544,
      "audioStart": 235.237,
      "spokenStart": 235.384,
      "spokenEnd": 237.101,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p01-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Apply the retain–distill–forget decision before your Agent's next long task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 4.848,
      "audioStart": 237.056,
      "spokenStart": 237.201,
      "spokenEnd": 241.237,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Give every candidate item six fields: the item, its next-task value, its state, its compact form, its retrieval cue, and its review date.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 8.976,
      "audioStart": 241.241,
      "spokenStart": 241.397,
      "spokenEnd": 249.48,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If a deployment constraint changes permissions, retain the verified constraint with the system and action that need it.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.288,
      "audioStart": 249.498,
      "spokenStart": 249.64,
      "spokenEnd": 255.096,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If a troubleshooting session reveals a repeatable fix, distill it into a short skill with a trigger, steps, evidence, and stopping condition.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.848,
      "audioStart": 255.103,
      "spokenStart": 255.256,
      "spokenEnd": 262.294,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If five transcripts repeat the same discovery, keep one traceable source and retire the duplicates from active retrieval.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.912,
      "audioStart": 262.302,
      "spokenStart": 262.454,
      "spokenEnd": 268.541,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "If you cannot name the next decision an item could improve, it probably does not deserve a permanent place in the Agent's working memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.008,
      "audioStart": 268.551,
      "spokenStart": 268.701,
      "spokenEnd": 274.9,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Chapter recap.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.776,
      "audioStart": 274.914,
      "spokenStart": 275.06,
      "spokenEnd": 275.844,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p07-u02",
      "sceneId": "c06-p07",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 6,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "First, write the decision value before saving memory.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.648,
      "audioStart": 275.804,
      "spokenStart": 275.944,
      "spokenEnd": 278.768,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p08-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p08",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 7,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Second, choose retain, distill, or forget deliberately.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.056,
      "audioStart": 278.776,
      "spokenStart": 278.928,
      "spokenEnd": 282.165,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c06-p09-u01",
      "sceneId": "c06-p09",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "paragraphIndex": 8,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Third, attach a retrieval cue and review date so memory can stay useful.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 4.752,
      "audioStart": 282.193,
      "spokenStart": 282.325,
      "spokenEnd": 286.267,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p01-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p01",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 0,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "An AI Agent does not become wiser by carrying every past message into every future task.",
      "gapBefore": 0.18,
      "audioDuration": 5.568,
      "audioStart": 286.295,
      "spokenStart": 286.447,
      "spokenEnd": 291.194,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.18
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p02-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p02",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 1,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Raw history remains useful for audit, but reusable facts and skills are usually better inputs for action.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.432,
      "audioStart": 291.2,
      "spokenStart": 291.354,
      "spokenEnd": 296.98,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p03-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p03",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 2,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Route memory from the current decision, then distill the result until the Agent can see what matters without reading the whole past.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.744,
      "audioStart": 296.983,
      "spokenStart": 297.14,
      "spokenEnd": 303.078,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p04-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p04",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 3,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Use the retain–distill–forget table to make storage, retrieval, and retirement explicit instead of accidental.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 6.792,
      "audioStart": 303.082,
      "spokenStart": 303.238,
      "spokenEnd": 309.208,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p05-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p05",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 4,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "The research result is encouraging, but treat it as evidence for testing your own memory design, not as a universal performance guarantee.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 7.488,
      "audioStart": 309.205,
      "spokenStart": 309.368,
      "spokenEnd": 316.027,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u01",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 0,
      "text": "Follow Tiny Agent.",
      "gapBefore": 0.16,
      "audioDuration": 1.944,
      "audioStart": 316.024,
      "spokenStart": 316.187,
      "spokenEnd": 317.324,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-p06-u02",
      "sceneId": "c07-p06",
      "chapterIndex": 6,
      "paragraphIndex": 5,
      "utteranceIndex": 1,
      "text": "Tiny Agent helps you get better at using AI.",
      "gapBefore": 0.1,
      "audioDuration": 3.144,
      "audioStart": 317.279,
      "spokenStart": 317.424,
      "spokenEnd": 319.755,
      "actualGapBefore": 0.1
    }
  ],
